    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d589">

                <pb facs="0664" n="584" sameAs="frus:frus1902/pg584"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The President of Guatemala to the President of the
                        United States.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Guatemala</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1902-09-04"><hi rendition="#italic">September 4,
                        1902</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>I regret the accident, and am glad that it was not grave.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">M. Estrada</hi>,<lb/><hi
                            rendition="#italic">President of Guatemala.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
